<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53861" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταδᾰπᾰν-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>squander</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν οὐσίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1316b23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ στρωμάτων βάρος κ. εἰς τἀπιτήδεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					6.2.30
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ Χρήματα</span>] 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεδεδαπάνητό σφι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.34
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>to be prodigal</i>, Pyrrho ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				10.419e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>consume</i>, of an army, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.2.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Ὅμηρον λιμὸς κατεδαπάνησεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sotad.
					15.16
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταδαπανᾶσθαι ἐν τῇ κακίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Wi.</u>
					5.13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεδαπανῶντο ταῖς μάστιξι τὰ σώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eun.
					<u>Hist.</u>
					p.269D.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>absorb, do away with</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				7.91
			</span></i>.</div>
